protester|Public opposition role not automatically violent or organizational membership. Cleaner-water sign translates faithfully and introduces no real person's political views or identity approval.
skeletal|Anatomical framework boundary is source supported, not a diagnosis or appearance judgment. Labelled diagram example and Vietnamese structures align; unsupported skeletal-thin sense is not claimed covered.
willpower|Determination/self-control rather than guaranteed outcome. Slow progress and continued practice retained in translation; grammar note avoids blaming people for obstacles or making therapeutic claims.
drum|Instrument striking surface meaning fits soft tapping. Usually qualifier accommodates varied instruments; Vietnamese timing and performer maintained, without inventing material or a music taxonomy.
fierce|Force intensity and aggression have separate ordinals. Wind versus dog contexts and all-night/approach relations translate correctly; growling does not become a factual claim of an attack.
